<chapter xml:id="ch7-chapter-generalize-conclusions" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Generalizing Conclusions</title>

  <introduction>
    <p> This chapter is about generalizing the conclusions made while performing statistical inference, 
      which is directly related to sampling methods. So, students will learn about random and convenience samples and
    judging representativeness of samples. </p>
